  "summary": "Lightwell Security Advisory: json-path 2.7.0.rhlw-00001",
  "details": "Red Hat Lightwell has released json-path 2.7.0.rhlw-00001 with a backported security fix.\n\nCVE-2023-51074: json-path v2.7.0 was discovered to contain a stack overflow via the Criteria.parse() method. A specially crafted JSON path expression can cause unbounded recursion leading to a denial of service.\n\nThis patched artifact is a drop-in replacement for json-path 2.7.0 from Maven Central.",
